From b617b98c61d81c203e501b88817ef8390c4cce4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ientzy <ientzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:55:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] Flash Next: DFlash2 drafter rounds on the Spark (BF16
 drafter, one lane)

The Inco DFlash2 drafter (hidden 2560) proposes the verify tokens when
NINFER_FLASH_DFLASH2 is set and the file set has a dflash2 component.
Target features are the stream mean after blocks 5/15/25/35/45, kept in a
2048-slot cyclic ring; the proposal rides the prompt-lookup verify path.
New: seven BF16 linear shapes, shape-generic glue kernels (flash_dflash).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
